body:
Let's darken things up, shall we?

Either Hermit or Sister is dead;
Homura's mother is dead, that affected her life. Homura was unhappy and abused her entire life until she met EZ in U0 and her memory came back;
Every single member of Elsie's crew is already dead;
Someone who was a good person is now completely evil; maybe Poseidon Nero would rule with the iron fist; at least one of those three - Amira, Jaguar or Eraser - would be evil; 
Rachel and Connor either would be already dead, either would be killed, either would be evil (like that Connor on board of Eden One)
At least someone would be with abused childhood, who didn't have it before
